<distribution-code display="yes">I</distribution-code><congress display="yes">119th CONGRESS</congress><session display="yes">2d Session</session><legis-num display="yes">H. R. 10225</legis-num><current-chamber>IN THE HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES</current-chamber><action display="yes"><action-date date="20260902">September 2, 2026</action-date><action-desc><sponsor name-id="B001309">Mr. Burchett</sponsor> introduced the following bill; which was referred to the <committee-name committee-id="HBA00">Committee on Financial Services</committee-name></action-desc></action><legis-type>A BILL</legis-type><official-title display="yes">To prohibit the use of Federal funds for housing assistance for aliens unlawfully present in the United States, and for other purposes.</official-title></form><legis-body id="H3234176DA230425D9978FCF542A6F6A7" style="OLC"> 
<section id="HC93BE799F4F64DE3889BDD8FD12FAAAF" section-type="section-one"><enum>1.</enum><header>Short title</header><text display-inline="no-display-inline">This Act may be cited as the <quote><short-title>No Federal Taxpayer-Funded Housing for Illegal Aliens Act of 2026</short-title></quote>.</text></section> <section id="H1002E090A65747B0ACA9C1E621ABF684"><enum>2.</enum><header>Funding prohibition</header> <subsection id="HB3FF24FB40AA404F84DF3F76E54B7130"><enum>(a)</enum><header>In general</header><text display-inline="yes-display-inline">No Federal funds may be used to provide covered housing assistance to an alien unlawfully present in the United States.</text></subsection> 
<subsection id="H8AB0DC77744E4E18AFAC3788F13184D4"><enum>(b)</enum><header>Exceptions</header><text display-inline="yes-display-inline">The prohibition described under subsection (a) shall not apply with respect to—</text> <paragraph id="HEC039864F5D648228A6D3C1B58CDC592"><enum>(1)</enum><text>the enforcement of the immigration laws (as such term is defined under section 101(a) of the Immigration and Nationality Act (<external-xref legal-doc="usc" parsable-cite="usc/8/1101">8 U.S.C. 1101(a)</external-xref>)); or</text></paragraph> 
<paragraph id="HCE15C59AB7024A7A98CA9C76EC524840"><enum>(2)</enum><text>the enforcement of any criminal laws.</text></paragraph></subsection> <subsection id="HFE4101299EE9453596F5DBA204AA510E"><enum>(c)</enum><header>Requirements</header><text>The head of each Federal agency shall take any action necessary to ensure compliance with subsection (a) and enforce any violation thereof, including—</text> 
<paragraph id="HD182B8C433C94E719301DB0FAFAD7DA9"><enum>(1)</enum><text>requiring any recipient of Federal funds to certify that any use of such funds will comply with subsection (a);</text></paragraph> <paragraph id="HFD99FC267DF14442A5028F11B8F3528B"><enum>(2)</enum><text>monitoring compliance with subsection (a);</text></paragraph> 
<paragraph id="H64DA2E32689F4D4E8696CEA3B5918DD3"><enum>(3)</enum><text>civil penalties; or</text></paragraph> <paragraph id="H918D6B8D4DE4412C9F49284AC299BDA4"><enum>(4)</enum><text display-inline="yes-display-inline">implementing a period of ineligibility for any recipient of Federal funds following a violation of subsection (a).</text> </paragraph></subsection> 
<subsection id="H363EBCF7668E45B0B36D99D7F7D67E24"><enum>(d)</enum><header>Covered housing assistance</header><text>In this section the term <term>covered housing assistance</term> includes—</text> <paragraph id="HB02288BEAE6043A28C316C931ED0EEA2"><enum>(1)</enum><text>rental assistance, including—</text> 
<subparagraph id="H8221E33204B74FE6A834AA192DF11DB7"><enum>(A)</enum><text>security deposits;</text></subparagraph> <subparagraph id="H2992DBBDCBCD4565BE8C45497F8C7137"><enum>(B)</enum><text>initial rental payments;</text></subparagraph> 
<subparagraph id="H2EC4203E49AE43A8B0971713222390B7"><enum>(C)</enum><text>rental arrears;</text></subparagraph> <subparagraph id="H9B494880BDFD40FB89509C9CB321B95F"><enum>(D)</enum><text>application fees; or</text></subparagraph> 
<subparagraph id="HEC295D5D3F674B3D95F234039273D50A"><enum>(E)</enum><text>any other cost associated with obtaining or maintaining rental housing.</text></subparagraph></paragraph> <paragraph id="H92C1C5B6103E492FAB1AA43E2CE5A13B"><enum>(2)</enum><text>housing vouchers;</text></paragraph> 
<paragraph id="HAAC32DE54E434B42ADF0A50358355208"><enum>(3)</enum><text>mortgage assistance;</text></paragraph> <paragraph id="H49BD7D0E09664FE2AACEE101084BA457"><enum>(4)</enum><text>utility assistance related to obtaining or maintaining housing;</text></paragraph> 
<paragraph id="H5536614854B44C4D83660B63E1744B3E"><enum>(5)</enum><text>hotel or motel accommodations;</text></paragraph> <paragraph id="HD8936B2078A84BD2946F4FCF103A43C3"><enum>(6)</enum><text>emergency, temporary, transition, or permanent housing accommodations;</text></paragraph> 
<paragraph id="HC9950A3013064504B3A74262D2ECB3F0"><enum>(7)</enum><text>stabilization services, including—</text> <subparagraph id="HEC219D4DEA4B4C1EA6C50AFB8C5B44CF"><enum>(A)</enum><text display-inline="yes-display-inline">searching for housing;</text></subparagraph> 
<subparagraph id="H9DBEEC55F03C4ABBA67ECDFC5994044F"><enum>(B)</enum><text>housing placement;</text></subparagraph> <subparagraph id="H7109CDB07CD54A2F9420F7760C9DDF98"><enum>(C)</enum><text>relocation;</text></subparagraph> 
<subparagraph id="H8A06DB44636F4CC688A2CB56F9EE17B4"><enum>(D)</enum><text>eviction prevention;</text></subparagraph> <subparagraph id="H6D139FE7246749B5B0778BA919EDB4D8"><enum>(E)</enum><text>landlord mediation;</text></subparagraph> 
<subparagraph id="H0F3393DF00984F43A52BD646E6C67600"><enum>(F)</enum><text>housing-retention assistance;</text></subparagraph> <subparagraph id="H29B45A8384784B76A7B0AAA8360460AC"><enum>(G)</enum><text>housing counseling;</text></subparagraph> 
<subparagraph id="H55C345BAEF334C998BDAAF55F924079B"><enum>(H)</enum><text>case management services; or</text></subparagraph> <subparagraph id="H2509EBCEFAFD411A9B35EE35ECA3F5B8"><enum>(I)</enum><text>any other service with the primary purpose of helping an individual maintain housing; and</text></subparagraph></paragraph> 
<paragraph id="HEB87C1A4F5FF4CE086A245425B901275"><enum>(8)</enum><text>any administrative or indirect costs related to providing the assistance described in paragraphs (1) through (8).</text></paragraph></subsection></section> </legis-body></bill>

